add('The starting-stack/ante ratio falls from 40 in Orbit 1 to 30, 26.7, then 25. Later games become tighter in ante-to-stack terms. At the default setting, however, elimination rates are roughly flat across the four orbits: all-in behavior dominates that escalation. Four full antes alone cost only 20/40/60/80 chips per player; betting losses drive the observed depletion.\n')
